# bench6-run1-lssd.plan — the walk of run 1b, the local-SSD deployment (bench6-run1-lssd.env). That env
# file pins it (RUN_ARMS_PLAN), so `launch.sh <env> arms` walks it; `--plan <file>` overrides the env.
# The format is bench6-run1.plan's (and README.md, "The plan").
#
# The control without and with the eviction, and the advice arm, with run 1's own steps for those arms and
# in run 1's relative order, so each row pairs with run 1's row; a0-prime brackets p1 for the drift correction.

a0-control      I L M4 M16
p1-mdbx-advice  M16
a0-prime        M16
